    "resolved_findings": [
      "Field/Bool types and complete identifier spans flow through every expression and binding.",
      "Terminal-context propagation distinguishes branch tails returned by a function from intermediate discarded values; every arm is checked.",
      "Coverage follows literal native conditions; direct-return reachability remains local, matching the seed.",
      "Owned reversed statement lists and postorder blocks preserve nested source ordering.",
      "Scope snapshots restore names; stable runtime slots preserve external mutation and isolate branch-local shadowing.",
      "Continue/Return formulas evaluate each continuation once and bypass it on return.",
      "Independent actual-generator depth and actual-parser nesting component probes distinguish their boundaries from full JOB admission.",
      "An isolated source/JOB empty-arms case exercises the block append cap independently of expression and nesting caps.",
      "Existing Field-condition documentation now matches the already established target-specific seed semantics."
    ]
